    "body": "`volume` actually isn't a content attribute, it's just an IDL attribute. And muted is quite strange, where the `muted` content attribute is reflected in the `defaultMuted` IDL attribute, and the `muted` IDL attribute is not affected by the content attribute after element creation. The `volumechange` event is tied to the `muted` and `volume` IDL attributes, i.e. has no connection to any content attribute.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
