    "body": "Wow - that is strange!\r\n\r\nI'll admit my understanding of the distinctions between content attributes and IDL attributes is elementary, but if `volume` isn't a content attribute, what would you call the `audio` element `volume` attribute specified [here](https://developer.mozilla.org/en/docs/Web/HTML/Element/audio#attr-volume)?",
