    "body": "I see - the MDN documentation is somewhat misleading, then, when it comes to the `volume` attribute (it appears to be something that can be specified in markup).\r\n\r\nI'd support the `loopchange` event or similar becoming standard if there were implementer interest, though if the thinking is \"one form of observation for content attributes, one form for IDL attributes,\" then I understand.",
