    "created_at": "2017-05-17T15:32:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-17T15:32:45Z",
    "body": "I think the trouble is that to implement this, one would internally observe changes to the attribute and just queue events when they happen, so looking at it one would wonder \"is this really needed?\"\r\n\r\n@cpearce, thoughts about this in Gecko?\r\n@jernoble, thoughts about this in WebKit?\r\n\r\nNot sure who to ask for Edge. For Chromium, I'll say \"probably not unless others are excited about it.\"",
